\par\par \b \uc2 Slovak crown further down on region, euro rumour   \b0\par\par\uc2 313 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Mai 2007\par 15:48\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 BRATISLAVA, May 25 (Reuters) - The Slovak crown weakened through 34.0 level against the euro to a 10-week low on Friday amid easing on global emerging markets and rumours of an early setting of an euro conversion rate for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 The crown traded in a volatile session as low as 34.130 to the euro, its weakest level since its peg to the euro in the exchange rate mechanism ERM-2 was revalued by 8.5 percent in mid-March, before rebounding slightly to 34.050 as of 1330 GMT.   \par \par \uc2 It traded at 33.850 late on Thursday.   \par \par \uc2 "There is profit taking in the whole region, which is mostly felt on the crown," said Tatra Banka trader Milan Cavojec. "It is partly an the effect of the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold an estimated 2.5 billion euros on the market in March and April \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  aimed at halting fast firming of the crown. Analysts have said the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  allowed foreign players to open bigger positions, which has made the crown more vulnerable to changes of sentiment on emerging markets.   \par \par \uc2 The crown also traditionally comes under pressure in April and May as local companies pay dividends to their foreign shareholders, traders said.   \par \par \uc2 In addition, several traders in Bratislava said the crown was also affected by a rumour that its conversion rate to the euro will be fixed in the near future.   \par \par \uc2 Slovakia plans to adopt the euro in 2009, with the conversion rate expected to be set at around mid 2008, but it has yet to meet inflation and fiscal criteria for euro zone entry.   \par \par \uc2 "The rumour is a factor moving the crown, however incredible or improbable it sounds," a foreign bank trader in Bratislava said.   \par \par \uc2 SLOVAKIA-CROWN/AFTERNOON|LANGEN|CZS|ABN|M|D|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070525e35p001gu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
