\par\par \b \uc2 Slovak Fin Min Says Euro-Zone CPI Criteria Will Be Met In 2H   \b0\par\par\uc2 315 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 April 2007\par 09:24\par \uc2 Dow Jones Emerging Markets Report\par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 BRATISLAVA (Dow Jones)--Slovak Finance Minister Jan Pociatek Tuesday said that the country will meet all criteria necessary for euro-zone accession in the second half of 2007.   \par \par \uc2 Speaking at a conference in the Slovak capital, Pociatek also said that the requirement to maintain stability of the Slovak koruna's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate isn't in jeopardy. [ 17-04-07 0732GMT ]   \par \par \uc2 The inflation and exchange rate stability requirements are perceived as the only potential threats to Slovakia's euro-zone entry, scheduled for 2009.   \par \par \uc2 Slovakia posted an annual 2.1% rise in its European Union-harmonized index of consumer prices, or HICP, in March, compared with a 2% year-on-year rise in February.   \par \par \uc2 Pociatek said that inflationary pressures will continue to abate, providing consumer price growth stays at the required levels in the second half of 2007.   \par \par \uc2 In order to qualify for the euro-zone membership the Slovak \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been pegged to the euro since late 2005 within the European Exchange RateMechanism, or ERM II, which allows the koruna to fluctuate plus or minus 15% around its peg to the euro.   \par \par \uc2 Fueled by rapid economic growth and foreign direct investment inflows, the koruna has firmed strongly since the country's accession to the European Union in May 2004.   \par \par \uc2 In March, Slovakia was allowed to revalue the koruna-euro peg by 8.5%. The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has also carried out several \b \highlight22\uc2 interventionsin\b0 \highlight\uc2  an attempt to ease pressure on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 Pociatek said despite the recent revaluation of the koruna's peg, the Slovak \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  remains stable.   \par \par \uc2 "Fulfillment the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate stability criterion is not threatened," he added.   \par \par \uc2 Finance Ministry Web site:   {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.finance.gov.sk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.finance.gov.sk  }}}\par \par \uc2 -By Sean Carney and Leos Rousek; Dow Jones Newswires; +420 221 085 272; sean.carney@dowjones.com [ 17-04-07 0805GMT ]   \par \par \uc2 Dokument EM00000020070417e34h0000l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
