ighlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 Pociatek said despite the recent revaluation of the koruna's peg, the Slovak \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  remains stable.   \par \par \uc2 "Fulfillment the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate stability criterion is not threatened," he added.   \par \par \uc2 Finance Ministry Web site:   {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.finance.gov.sk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.finance.gov.sk  }}}\par \par \uc2 -By Sean Carney and Leos Rousek; Dow Jones Newswires; +420 221 085 272; sean.carney@dowjones.com [ 17-04-07 0805GMT ]   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020070417e34h000bw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
