\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Slovak \highlight\uc2  cbanker says SKK  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  effective   \b0\par\par\uc2 315 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 April 2007\par 12:05\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (adds more quotes, background)   \par \par \uc2 BRATISLAVA, April 5 (Reuters) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's (NBS) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to halt the rise of the crown \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday morning was effective, NBS board member Peter Sevcovic told Reuters on Thursday.   \par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was certainly effective because the exchange rate depreciated slightly," he said on the sidelines of an economic conference, adding the bank was prepared to act further if needed.   \par \par \uc2 Dealers in Bratislava said the NBS started selling crowns on the market early on Wednesday when it traded at around 33.100 per euro, its strongest level since March 20 when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 The bank confirmed it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , saying it had done so because of the crown's increased volatility and "unjustified" moves in recent days.   \par \par \uc2 But it did not comment on the details of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which weakened the crown as far as 33.700 per euro <EURSKK=>. The unit traded at 33.465 as of 1007 GMT.   \par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was correct because the firming of the crown over the past weeks, and past few days was too fast when compared to economic developments," Sevcovic said.   \par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will keep monitoring, assessing and reacting (to \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market developments)," he added.   \par \par \uc2 The NBS has repeatedly said the crown should move around the ERM-2 central rate of 35.4424 per euro, which it sees to be near the equilibrium level justified by economic fundamentals.   \par \par \uc2 The strong crown has helped the NBS to curb inflation as Slovakia moves closer to its aim of entering the euro zone in 2009.   \par \par \uc2 The NBS cut the main two-week repo rate by 25 basis points to 4.50 percent at the end of March after the rising crown tightened monetary conditions.   \par \par \uc2 SLOVAKIA-CROWN/CBANKER (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|E|RBN|CZS|BNX|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070408e3450006d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
