\par\par \b \uc2 Slovakia - Factors To Watch on April 5   \b0\par\par\uc2 550 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 April 2007\par 08:38\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 BRATISLAVA, April 5 (Reuters) - Here are news stories, press reports and events to watch which may affect Slovak financial markets on Thursday.   \par \par \uc2 OECD SECRETARY GEN MEETS PM FICO   \par \par \uc2 OECD Secretary General Angel Gurria will meet Slovak PM Fico (0700 GMT), news conference around 9.30 a.m. (0730 GMT). Gurria will then present a new economic survey on Slovakia at a foreign ministry conference (0800 GMT).   \par \par \uc2 FOREIGN \b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2  RESERVES   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will publish weekly foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves data, 2 p.m. (1200 GMT).   \par \par \uc2 C.BANK \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENES\b0 \highlight\uc2  TO CURB CROWN   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (NBS) extended its fight to curb the crown's strength with a second market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in as many weeks on Wednesday, and warned it would continue to correct unwanted \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swings.   \par \par \uc2 [ID:nL04306239] [RTRS-CEN-MMT-FRX-SK]   \par \par \uc2 C.BANK CHIEF SAYS CROWN STILL OVERVALUED   \par \par \uc2 The Slovak crown's strength remains excessive and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue to fight its undesirable appreciation, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (NBS) Governor Ivan Sramko said on Wednesday.   \par \par \uc2 [ID:nL04690761] [RTRS-MMT-GVD-CEN-SK]   \par \par \uc2 OECD URGES SLOVAKS TO KEEP TIGHT BUDGET IN EURO   \par \par \uc2 The OECD urged Slovakia on Wednesday to keep fiscal policy prudent after its planned switch to the euro in 2009 to avoid an economic "boom and bust".   \par \par \uc2 [ID:nL0494800] [RTRS-EUR-PLCY-SK]   \par \par \uc2 MARCH INFLATION SEEN UP FROM RECORD LOWS   \par \par \uc2 Slovakia's March inflation is expected to have edged up from February's record low and the strength of the crown \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has boosted chances of a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  interest rate cut this month, a Reuters poll showed on Wednesday.   \par \par \uc2 [ID:nL04575042] [RTRS-PRE-ECI-PLCY-INT-SK]   \par \par \uc2 PRESS DIGEST   \par \par \uc2 ------------   \par \par \uc2 SLOVAKS BACK U.N. KOSOVO RESOLUTION   \par \par \uc2 The United Nations Security Council started a closed-door meeting on the status of the southern Serbian province Kosovo, with the Slovak envoy expressing support of the Ahtisaari's plan of Kosovo independence, contrary to comments by Prime Minister Robert Fico.   \par \par \uc2 Sme, page 1   \par \par \uc2 PENSION SYSTEM CHANGES   \par \par \uc2 The government adjourned debate on the labour ministry's analysis of the changes to the pension system, after the HZDS party, a junior ruling coalition member, opposed major changes to the system and with Fico saying more details were needed for debate.   \par \par \uc2 Pravda, page 1   \par \par \uc2 For news on upcoming events in the United States and other Group of Seven countries, see <G7TODAY>. For a diary of forthcoming Slovak events, double click [SK/DIARY], and a calendar of east European economic indicators, see [CONV/DIARY].   \par \par \uc2 News editor of the day: Peter Laca, on +421 2 5341 8402; fax: +421 2 5341 8403   \par \par \uc2 E-mail: editorial@reuters.sk   \par \par \uc2 Reuters Messaging: pater.laca.reuters.com@reuters.net For real-time index quotes, double click in brackets: Warsaw WIG20 <.WIG20> Budapest BUX <.BUX> Prague PX50 <.PX50> Other related news:    \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Slovak equities      [SK-E]  E.Europe equities           [.CEE]\par  Slovak money         [SK-M]  Czech debt                  [CZ-D]\par  Slovak Indicators  [SK-ECI]  Emerging \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2           [EMRG/FRX]\par  Eastern European     [EEU]   All emerging markets        [EMRG]\par  Hot stocks           [HOT]   Stock markets                [STX]\par  Market debt news     [DBT]   \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  news                   [FRX]\par  TOP NEWS -- Emerging markets                         [TOP/EMRG]\par  TOP NEWS -- Convergence watch                        [TOP/EAST]\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 Slovakia - Factors To Watch on April 5|LANGEN|Table|CZS|ABN|M|D|E|RBN|REVU|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070405e345000dm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
