\par\par \b \uc2 TABLE- \highlight22\uc2 Slovak \highlight\uc2  c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  reserves jump after  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 188 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2007\par 13:33\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 March 30 (Reuters) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's (NBS) foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves jumped to $16.587 billion as of March 28 from $14.771 billion the previous week, the bank said on Friday.   \par \par \uc2 The NBS did not give a reason for the rise, but it came during the period when it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to weaken the crown from its record of 32.710 per euro <EURSKK=>.   \par \par \uc2 Dealers have estimated the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had bought as much as 2 billion euros.   \par \par \uc2 The bank is expected to report the size of its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  after a board meeting on April 27.   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 SLOVAK\b0 \highlight\uc2  FOREIGN RESERVES MARCH 28 MARCH 21 MARCH 14 ($ million)    \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2               16,587.4    14,770.9   14,721.3\par  Commercial banks           3,439.5     4,236.9    3,210.4\par  Total banking sector      20,026.9    19,007.8   17,931.7\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 NOTE: Reserves data are calculated according to methodology compatible with European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  standards.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (Reporting by Martin Santa in Bratislava)   \f28 \par \par \uc2 SLOVAKIA-RESERVES/ (TABLE)|LANGEN|Table|ABN|D|M|CZS   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070330e33u00143\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict