rcent in 2006 and is expected to accelerate further in 2007, helped by foreign direct investments and the country's aim to adopt the euro in 2009.  \par \par \uc2 The NBS has repeatedly said the new ERM-2 central rate was close to what it considered an equilibrium rate justified by economic fundamentals, and that the crown should move near that level.  \par \par \uc2 SLOVAKIA-CROWN/SRAMKO (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|CZS|BNX|DNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070321e33l001dc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
