\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 3- \highlight22\uc2 Slovak \highlight\uc2  crown hits new record, c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 By Martin Santa   \par \uc2 616 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2007\par 09:10\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Writes through with \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 )   \par \par \uc2 BRATISLAVA, March 8 (Reuters) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market on Thursday to halt firming of the crown after news of foreign direct investment inflows and accelerating economic growth drove the unit to new record highs.   \par \par \uc2 The Slovak unit firmed as far as 33.800 per euro, up 1 percent from Wednesday, but several waves of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (NBS) \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  knocked it back to 34.080 as of 1550 GMT, dealers said.   \par \par \uc2 NBS officials were not available for comment on the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Analysts said the NBS looked unhappy with the fast rise of the crown, which was the reason it had cited in the past when it tried to regulate the unit's movements.   \par \par \uc2 "An \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was expected, the only question was at what level it would come," said Maria Valachyova, a senior analyst at Slovenska Sporitelna.   \par \par \uc2 "In the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's view, the crown is stronger than what would be justified by fundamentals," Valachyova said.   \par \par \uc2 The Slovak \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has firmed more than 4 percent against the euro in the past six weeks, from this year's lows of 35.440. The previous all-time high was 34.050 per euro, which the unit hit at the end of December.   \par \par \uc2 Slovakia posted record gross domestic product growth of 8.3 percent in 2006, driven mainly by investments in its export-oriented car industry. Latest data for industrial output showed a 17.5 percent year-on-year increase in January.   \par \par \uc2 Investors have been lured to crowns by Slovakia's plan to adopt the euro in 2009, ahead of the neighbouring Czech Republic, Poland and Hungary which are struggling to cut fiscal deficits.   \par \par \uc2 The Slovak crown received a fresh boost on Thursday as South Korea's  \uc2 Samsung Electronics\uc2  confirmed it had picked Slovakia for a new liquid crystal display assembly plant.   \par \par \uc2 Economic growth is expected to accelerate further this year and beat the 2006 rate as new car assembly plants of  \uc2 PSA Peugeot\uc2 Peugeot Citroen\uc2  and  \uc2 Kia Motors\uc2 , completed last year, boost production.   \par \par \uc2 ERM-2 PARITY TALK   \par \par \uc2 The crown was the best performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in central Europe in 2006, rising by almost 10 percent against the euro. The last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to knock the crown down from its previous record highs came in December.   \par \par \uc2 However, it used repo tenders early in 2007 to leave the banks with billions of crown of excess liquidity in order to make the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  less attractive for hot money.   \par \par \uc2 "With strong economic fundamentals, it will be difficult for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to undermine bullish sentiment towards the crown," said 4Cast analyst Piotr Matys.   \par \par \uc2 "The bank is now likely to use its strategy of rejecting part of the bids at 2-week repo auction next week," he said.   \par \par \uc2 The unit's firming has helped to keep a lid on consumer prices, aiding Slovakia's attempts to meet its euro adoption plan.   \par \par \uc2 The crown is now 11.8 percent above the central parity rate of its plus/minus 15 percent fluctuation band set in the exchange rate mechanism ERM-2, within which an euro-applicant country must prove \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  stability.   \par \par \uc2 The crown's latest rise has renewed market talk about a possible shift in the parity rate as analysts said economic growth and rising productivity would justify a stronger level.   \par \par \uc2 "The NBS may try to slow down crown firming for some more time, but fundamentals speak in favour of a parity shift," said CSOB bank analyst Marek Gabris.   \par \par \uc2 SLOVAKIA-CROWN/RECORD (UPDATE 3)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|CZS|RBN|BNX|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070308e338000u7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
