\par\par \b \uc2 Slovakia - Factors To Watch on Jan 2  \b0\par\par\uc2 447 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Januar 2007\par 09:07\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 BRATISLAVA, Jan 2 (Reuters) - Here are news stories, press reports and events to watch which may affect Slovak financial markets on Tuesday.  \par \par \uc2 2006 BUDGET DATA  \par \par \uc2 The finance ministry will release central state budget data for 2006.  \par \par \uc2 TWO-WEEK REPO TENDER  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will hold a regular two-week repo tender to drain crown liquidity from the market.  \par \par \uc2 CROWN FLAT AFTER \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2 , UPSIDE SEEN  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak\b0 \highlight\uc2  crown was quiet on Friday after \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  knocked it off its record highs versus the euro in the previous session, but dealers expected more upward pressure early in 2007.  \par \par \uc2 [ID:nL29809960] [RTRS-MMT-FRX-SK-LEN]  \par \par \uc2 C.BANK \b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2  RESERVES DIP TO $13.39 BLN  \par \par \uc2 The Slovak \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves dropped to $13.394 billion as of Dec. 27, from $13.402 billion one week earlier, the bank said on Friday.  \par \par \uc2 [ID:nL29917455] [RTRS-CEN-FRX-SK]  \par \par \uc2 PRESS DIGEST  \par \par \uc2 ------------  \par \par \uc2 FIRST BLOCK OF BOHUNICE NUCLEAR PLANT SHUT DOWN  \par \par \uc2 Slovakia shut down the first block of the country's oldest nuclear power plant at Jaslovske Bohunice on Sunday. Slovakia had pledged to decommission the soviet-style nuclear power plant in the accession treaty with the European Union.  \par \par \uc2 Sme, page 4  \par \par \uc2 TAX CHANGES  \par \par \uc2 Changes to the tax system, such as introduction of lower VAT on drugs and selected medical goods or cuts in relief measures for highest earners, became effective on January 1.  \par \par \uc2 Sme, page 7  \par \par \uc2 SPAR EYES SLOVAKIA  \par \par \uc2 Dutch retailer Spar has asked for trademark registration in Slovakia, bud declined to comment on any further plans, daily Hospodarske Noviny reported.  \par \par \uc2 Hospodarske Noviny, page 13  \par \par \uc2 For an economic indicator diary for the euro zone, the United States and other Group of Seven countries, see <G7TODAY>. For a diary of forthcoming Slovak events, double click [SK/DIARY], and a calendar of east European economic indicators, see [CONV/DIARY].  \par \par \uc2 News editor of the day: Peter Laca on +421 2 5341 8402; fax: +421 2 5341 8403  \par \par \uc2 E-mail: bratislava.newsroom@reuters.com  \par \par \uc2 Reuters Messaging: peter.laca.reuters.com@reuters.net For real-time index quotes, double click in brackets: Warsaw WIG20 <.WIG20> Budapest BUX <.BUX> Prague PX50 <.PX50> Other related news:   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Slovak equities      [SK-E]  E.Europe equities           [.CEE]\par  Slovak money         [SK-M]  Czech debt                  [CZ-D]\par  Slovak Indicators  [SK-ECI]  Emerging \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2           [EMRG/FRX]\par  Eastern European     [EEU]   All emerging markets        [EMRG]\par  Hot stocks           [HOT]   Stock markets                [STX]\par  Market debt news     [DBT]   \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  news                   [FRX]\par  TOP NEWS -- Emerging markets                         [TOP/EMRG]\par  TOP NEWS -- Convergence watch                        [TOP/EAST]\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Slovakia - Factors To Watch on Jan 2|LANGEN|Table|CZS|ABN|M|D|E|RBN|REVU|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070102e3120008x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\pic