urrency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 2009.  \par \par \uc2 The market now waits to see whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  takes further steps to influence the exchange rate when more investors return to the market after year-end holidays.  \par \par \uc2 SLOVAKIA-CROWN/|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|CZS|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020061229e2ct000pf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
