\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Slovak \highlight\uc2  cbank reserves drop on crown  \highlight22\uc2 interventions \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 443 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Juli 2006\par 14:01\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (adds background, analyst)  \par \par \uc2 BRATISLAVA, July 21 (Reuters) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves dropped sharply in the week to July 19, data released on Friday showed, raising questions over the bank's ability to ward off a speculative attack on the crown.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (NBS) said in a statement its reserves dropped to $13.060 billion in the week to July 19, from $15.466 billion a week earlier.  \par \par \uc2 The NBS said the reserves data included changes from several rounds of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market after investors fled \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak\b0 \highlight\uc2  assets fearing a new leftist government -- elected in mid-June -- will loosen policy.  \par \par \uc2 The bank did not reveal the exact amount of the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  and their effect on reserves, though the amounts were roughly in line with market expectations.  \par \par \uc2 "We will unveil the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  volumes for June on Tuesday (July 25)," \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spokesman Igor Barat told Reuters adding July's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  volumes will be published by the end of August.  \par \par \uc2 Analysts have said the Slovak \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's costly battle to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  looks doomed to fail unless the new government convinces investors it is equally serious about swift euro zone membership.  \par \par \uc2 Newly-appointed Prime Minister Robert Fico, long ambiguous about the euro, recently met with \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Ivan Sramko and sought to calm those fears by declaring his commitment to the euro target and promising to co-ordinate policies with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 But markets refused to take those assurances at face value, worried that some of his proposals did not square with budget targets laid out in the country's euro roadmap and that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not have the reserves to fight speculators for an extended period.  \par \par \uc2 "With the market already uncertain about the sufficiency of NBS reserves to continue the defence against EUR/SKK upside, the deterioration (of reserves) will intensify rising talk over the possibilty of a speculative attack on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Craig Otter, an analyst at 4castweb.  \par \par \uc2 Analysts say a small, open economy such as Slovakia needs a strong \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to slash inflation to the bank's 2.0 percent target from 4.5 percent, and a Reuters poll of analysts on Friday showed most expect the bank to start to use interest rate increases to help in the battle.  \par \par \uc2 Some economists have said the current market turbulence, against the backdrop of a generally less favourable emerging markets investment climate, showed Slovakia's entry into the ERM-2 grid last November may have been premature.  \par \par \uc2 ECONOMY-SLOVAKIA-RESERVES (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|CZS|DNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060721e27l001dp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
