\par\par \b \uc2 Slovakia - Factors To Watch on June 23  \b0\par\par\uc2 460 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Juni 2006\par 08:51\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 BRATISLAVA, June 23 (Reuters) - Here are news stories, press reports and events to watch which may affect Slovak financial markets on Friday.  \par \par \uc2 ETHNIC HUNGARIANS MEET CHRISTIAN DEMOCRATS  \par \par \uc2 The ethnic Hungarian hold post-election talks with Christian Democrats (0630 GMT).  \par \par \uc2 C.BANK TO RELEASE \b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2  RESERVES DATA  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to release weekly \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves data (1200 GMT).  \par \par \uc2 SPP NEWS CONFERENCE  \par \par \uc2 The natural gas distribution and transportation company SPP to hold a news conference.  \par \par \uc2 CHRISTIAN DEMOCRATS MULL JOINING LEFTIST GOVT  \par \par \uc2 Slovakia's Christian Democrats may join a leftist government to protect liberal reforms, a party official said on Thursday, as politicians attempt to form a ruling coalition after indecisive elections. [ID:nL22795012]  \par \par \uc2 CROWN STABILISES AFTER C.BANK \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak\b0 \highlight\uc2  crown weathered a bearish regional mood on Thursday better than its neighbours following supportive \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday, dealers said. [ID:nL22248995]  \par \par \uc2 PRESS DIGEST  \par \par \uc2 CHRISTIAN DEMOCRATS OPPOSE NATIONALISTS IN GOVT  \par \par \uc2 The Christian Democrats will not join a government with the far-right nationalist party SNS, the daily Pravda reports. If confirmed, the move would reduce ruling coalition options for the leftists Smer party.  \par \par \uc2 Pravda, page 1  \par \par \uc2 SMER EYES CHRISTIAN DEMOCRATS  \par \par \uc2 The leftist party Smer awaits a decision by Christian Democrats whether to join its government or become an opposition party, the daily Sme reports. The talks on forming the ruling coalition will be complicated and they could take several weeks, the daily reports parties officials as saying.  \par \par \uc2 Sme, page 1  \par \par \uc2 SLOVAK SUPPLIES FOR OPEL TO TRIPLE  \par \par \uc2 Slovak car parts makers supplying German car producer Opel expect to triple their output in 2006 to 3.0 billion crowns ($99.30 million), the daily Pravda reports.  \par \par \uc2 Pravda, page 9  \par \par \uc2 For an economic indicator diary for the euro zone, the United States and other Group of Seven countries, see <G7TODAY>. For a diary of forthcoming Slovak events, double click [SK/DIARY], and for a calendar of east European economic indicators, see [CONV/DIARY].  \par \par \uc2 News editor of the day: Peter Laca on +421 2 5341 8402; fax: +421 2 5341 8403  \par \par \uc2 E-mail: reuters@editorial.sk  \par \par \uc2 Reuters Messaging: peter.laca.com@reuters.net For real-time index quotes, double click in brackets: Warsaw WIG20 <.WIG20> Budapest BUX <.BUX> Prague PX50 <.PX50> Other related news:   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Slovak equities      [SK-E]  E.Europe equities           [.CEE]\par  Slovak money         [SK-M]  Czech debt                  [CZ-D]\par  Slovak Indicators  [SK-ECI]  Emerging \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2           [EMRG/FRX]\par  Eastern European     [EEU]   All emerging markets        [EMRG]\par  Hot stocks           [HOT]   Stock markets                [STX]\par  Market debt news     [DBT]   \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  news                   [FRX]\par  TOP NEWS -- Emerging markets                         [TOP/EMRG]\par  TOP NEWS -- Convergence watch                        [TOP/EAST]\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Slovakia - Factors To Watch on June 23|LANGEN|Table|CZS|ABN|M|D|E|RBN|REVU|RNP|DNP|PTD|