\par\par \b \uc2 TRADE IDEA-PLN 2s5s flattener attractive-CSFB  \b0\par\par\uc2 266 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Dezember 2005\par 08:39\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 LONDON, Dec 6 (Reuters) - CSFB believes markets are entering a new multi-month period of the Polish zloty <EURPLN=> curve flattening, both in absolute terms and relative to the euro-curve, after five months of sustained curve steepening.  \par \par \uc2 "We therefore recommended on 2 December 2005 taking profit on our PLN 2s5s steepener trade, initiated on 21 July 2005 at +21bp and currently trading at +19bp," analysts Koon Chow and Olivier Desbarres said.  \par \par \uc2 "The market implies only 15bp of flattening in Poland versus Europe over the next 12 months, a not insurmountable hurdle given the 80bp widening in the box spread in the past year," CSFB said. In Hungary, CSFB recommends take profit on Hungarian forint <EURHUF=> 2s5s steepener.  \par \par \uc2 In Slovakia, CSFB is more bullish on the crown after ERM2.  \par \par \uc2 "We view this as being positive for the Slovak crown (SKK) <EURSKK=> for a number of reasons: (i) It signals the government's commitment to EMU membership and predictable monetary and fiscal policy and; (ii) ERM2 suggests an asymmetric \b \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  bias for the \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , more aggressively against SKK-weakness than strength.  \par \par \uc2 As inflation in Slovakia is rising, CSFB believes the Slovak \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  favors SKK-strength and probably hoped to engineer some \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  appreciation with earlier-than-expected ERM2 adoption.  \par \par \uc2 CSFB has have revised its EUR/SKK forecasts lower. We expect 37.0, 36.5 and 36.0 in 3-, 6- and 12-months, respectively (from the previous 38.0, 37.6, 37.2)  \par \par \uc2 TRADE IDEA-ZLOTY/CROWN|LANGEN|CZS|HX|PX  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020051206e1c6000jq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
