ows in the region. -------------------MARKET SNAPSHOT AT 1500 GMT------------------ Crown/euro <EURSKK=> at 38.870/890 vs 38.940/960 on Thursday Crown/dollar <SKK=> at 32.132/182 vs. 32.605/655 5-yr yield <SK5YT=RR> at 3.284/2.984 pct vs 3.285/2.986 pct 9-yr yield <SK9YT=RR> at 3.378/178 pct vs 3.378/177 pct ---------------------------------------------------------------  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-SLOVAKIA-CROWN-CLOSE|LANGEN|Table|ABN|M|D|CZS|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020051014e1ae001ie\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
